        "original_id": "59a5deb5-2456-5821-9530-c141574ef7ff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Likwit Crew\n- People: Xzibit, Defari, Phil Da Agony, Lootpack, Styliztik Jones, Declaime, J. Wells\n- Products: Street Music\n- Topics: West Coast hip hop\n\nFacts:\n- The Likwit Crew is a West Coast hip hop collective.\n- Other artists who joined the Likwit Crew include Xzibit, Phil Da Agony, Lootpack, Defari, Styliztik Jones, Declaime, J. Wells, and The Barbershop MC's.\n- Alvin Nathaniel Joiner was born on September 18, 1974, and he is better known by the stage name Xzibit.\n- Xzibit is an American rapper, actor, television host, radio personality, and record producer.\n- Xzibit is known as the host of the MTV show \"Pimp My Ride,\" which brought him mainstream success.\n- Street Music is the third album by Defari, an American hip hop musician who is also part of the Likwit Crew.",
